+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits and receives the summed `inputTokens`, `outputTokens`, and `totalTokens` from every provider call in the turn, so tool rounds are included in a deployer's billing or audit total ([validated by: reports the summed usage from every provider call in a turn with two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestratorUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L44)).
